{"SystemName":"Customer.OutOfStock","Title":"{{Store.Name}} - \u00DCr\u00FCn Tekrar Stokta Bildirimi","Content":"\u003Chtml\u003E\u003Chead\u003E\u003Cmeta name=\u0022viewport\u0022 content=\u0022width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\u0022\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003Ebody{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#333;margin:0;padding:0}.container{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;border:1px solid #eaeaea;border-radius:5px}.header{text-align:center;padding:15px 0;border-bottom:2px solid #f0f0f0;margin-bottom:20px}.logo{margin-bottom:10px;font-size:24px;font-weight:bold;color:#3498db}.content{padding:20px 0}.product-info{background-color:#f9f9f9;border-radius:4px;padding:15px;margin:15px 0}.button{display:inline-block;background-color:#3498db;color:#ffffff !important;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:4px;margin-top:15px;font-weight:bold}.button:hover{background-color:#2980b9}.footer{margin-top:30px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;font-size:12px;color:#999;text-align:center}@media only screen and (max-width:480px){.container{width:100%;padding:10px}.content{padding:10px}.button{display:block;text-align:center}}\u003C/style\u003E\u003C/head\u003E\u003Cbody\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022container\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022header\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022{{Store.URL}}\u0022 class=\u0022logo\u0022\u003E{{Store.Name}}\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022content\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMerhaba {{Customer.FullName}},\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETakip listenizdeki \u00FCr\u00FCn tekrar stokta! Bu haber i\u00E7in heyecanl\u0131y\u0131z.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022product-info\u0022\u003E\u003Ch3\u003E\u00DCr\u00FCn: {{OutOfStockSubscription.ProductName}}\u003C/h3\u003E{{#if OutOfStockSubscription.AttributeInfo}}\u003Cp\u003E\u00D6zellikler: {{OutOfStockSubscription.AttributeInfo}}\u003C/p\u003E{{/if}}\u003Cp\u003E\u0130yi haber! Uzun zamand\u0131r bekledi\u011Finiz \u00FCr\u00FCn \u015Fu anda stoklar\u0131m\u0131zda mevcut.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022{{OutOfStockSubscription.ProductUrl}}\u0022 class=\u0022button\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003E\u00DCr\u00FCn\u00FC G\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FCle\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cp\u003EStok miktar\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 olabilece\u011Finden, ilgileniyorsan\u0131z en k\u0131sa s\u00FCrede sipari\u015F vermenizi \u00F6neririz.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHerhangi bir sorunuz varsa, m\u00FC\u015Fteri hizmetlerimizle ileti\u015Fime ge\u00E7mekten \u00E7ekinmeyin.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETe\u015Fekk\u00FCrler,\u003Cbr\u003E{{Store.Name}} Ekibi\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022footer\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBu e-posta, {{Store.Name}} taraf\u0131ndan {{Customer.Email}} adresine, stok bildirim talebiniz nedeniyle g\u00F6nderilmi\u015Ftir.\u003C/p\u003E{{#if Store.CompanyAddress}}\u003Cp\u003E{{Store.CompanyAddress}}\u003C/p\u003E{{/if}}{{#if Store.CompanyPhoneNumber}}\u003Cp\u003ETel: {{Store.CompanyPhoneNumber}}\u003C/p\u003E{{/if}}\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/body\u003E\u003C/html\u003E","LiquidTokens":null}